WEBVTT

00:00:00.494 --> 00:00:05.364
Yume kara samete mo
Even if I wake from my dreams

00:00:06.404 --> 00:00:11.734
Kono te wo nobasu yo
I'll reach my hand out to you

00:00:23.384 --> 00:00:28.654
Onaji tsuyosa de yobi au
If our hearts can reach each other

00:00:29.394 --> 00:00:34.094
Kokoro ni nareru no naraba
with the same strength

00:00:35.264 --> 00:00:40.534
Nanninbun no kizu demo
Then I would be able to bare

00:00:41.074 --> 00:00:46.204
Boku wa uketome rareru yo
The pain of many hearts

00:00:46.604 --> 00:00:50.134
Mousukoshi datte kiga surun da
I can feel that it will arrive soon

00:00:50.214 --> 00:00:55.374
Kono kabe ga kuzureru
When these walls will be torn down

00:00:56.014 --> 00:01:00.514
Reimei
The dawn

00:01:02.094 --> 00:01:08.054
Yume kara samete mo
mada minai yume no houmade
Even if we wake from our dreams
We'll have to keep running

00:01:08.134 --> 00:01:14.034
Bokura wa hitori de
hashiri tsuzukeru shika nain da
Towards our unrevealed dreams

00:01:14.104 --> 00:01:20.664
Korogari mayotte tsukuri dasu
boku no inryoku ga
The gravity by my painful journey
will draw me

00:01:20.944 --> 00:01:26.814
Itsuka kimi e
To you one day

00:02:08.894 --> 00:02:11.084
So, I came here after all.

00:02:11.824 --> 00:02:14.384
Well, what should I start with?

00:02:26.844 --> 00:02:28.904
What's with these prices?

00:02:31.014 --> 00:02:32.504
What a rip off.

00:02:32.584 --> 00:02:34.914
Do you mind? I can hear you!

00:02:35.114 --> 00:02:37.104
What part of this
is a rip off, anyway?

00:02:37.184 --> 00:02:38.154
What part?

00:02:38.324 --> 00:02:39.344
All of it.

00:02:41.654 --> 00:02:43.754
Pilocchio...

00:02:43.824 --> 00:02:45.984
Don't you have any
common sense, Pilocchio?

00:02:46.294 --> 00:02:49.194
This is a fair price
in The World right now.

00:02:49.564 --> 00:02:52.964
And you have no right
to use my name so casually.

00:02:53.234 --> 00:02:57.634
Anyway, have you seen the prices
in all the shops around here?

00:02:58.104 --> 00:03:00.504
Are you a newbie?

00:03:01.274 --> 00:03:02.364
No.

00:03:02.914 --> 00:03:05.074
Why are you lying about
something like that?

00:03:05.514 --> 00:03:08.344
Well, you can't buy anything
since you just started.

00:03:08.414 --> 00:03:11.014
I suppose I can understand
your complaints...

00:03:15.454 --> 00:03:17.554
Don't tell me you're...

00:03:18.994 --> 00:03:20.184
...Tawaraya?

00:03:20.264 --> 00:03:22.894
I don't know of any PC
called Tawaraya.

00:03:23.364 --> 00:03:24.524
But, what about this?

00:03:25.434 --> 00:03:26.904
I'm Tohta.

00:03:27.004 --> 00:03:31.304
But, this...
Are you sure you're not Tawaraya?

00:03:31.374 --> 00:03:32.434
I'm not.

00:03:32.744 --> 00:03:35.264
There were people who spoke
badly about him, but...

00:03:35.344 --> 00:03:36.864
You've got the wrong guy.

00:03:36.984 --> 00:03:39.174
Anyway, can I ask you something?

00:03:41.214 --> 00:03:44.704
What's going on with the prices
on all these items?

00:03:45.024 --> 00:03:48.984
TaN fell apart,
then before we knew it...

00:03:49.054 --> 00:03:50.324
...there was an inflation.

00:03:50.394 --> 00:03:51.654
Before you knew it?

00:03:51.724 --> 00:03:52.694
Yeah.

00:03:54.264 --> 00:03:57.024
Where did all of TaN's
inventory and funds go?

00:03:57.204 --> 00:04:00.934
I don't really know,
but it probably all disappeared.

00:04:01.004 --> 00:04:02.404
I see.

00:04:02.634 --> 00:04:05.404
So, the inflation wasn't
because of that.

00:04:05.904 --> 00:04:09.774
I've read on the forum that some
traders have been at work recently.

00:04:10.114 --> 00:04:11.584
A trader?

00:04:12.184 --> 00:04:14.084
You mean Real Money Trading?

00:04:14.284 --> 00:04:15.254
Probably.

00:04:17.724 --> 00:04:19.214
Sounds like trouble.

00:04:23.224 --> 00:04:25.384
I really think that's Tawaraya.

00:04:29.564 --> 00:04:31.324
I wonder if Tabby's here.

00:04:31.634 --> 00:04:35.194
It's an online game, so don't expect
her to always be logged in.

00:04:35.274 --> 00:04:36.264
I guess.

00:04:37.704 --> 00:04:39.004
Come on, let's go!

00:04:39.144 --> 00:04:40.834
I don't have much time.

00:04:41.144 --> 00:04:42.114
Yeah.

00:04:46.914 --> 00:04:48.284
You have a minute?

00:04:48.354 --> 00:04:49.314
Huh?

00:04:55.294 --> 00:04:56.624
Tohta?

00:04:56.824 --> 00:04:57.884
Tohta.

00:04:57.994 --> 00:05:00.054
Tohta of Tawara...

00:05:00.124 --> 00:05:01.754
Is that you, Tawaraya?

00:05:03.364 --> 00:05:05.024
There's something I want to ask you.

00:05:05.234 --> 00:05:06.294
What is it?

00:05:06.364 --> 00:05:07.804
I want to meet Naobi.

00:05:07.904 --> 00:05:08.874
Where is he?

00:05:08.934 --> 00:05:11.904
Don't assume
that I know everything.

00:05:12.004 --> 00:05:13.994
You should know.

00:05:14.174 --> 00:05:16.114
How can you be so sure?

00:05:16.174 --> 00:05:19.044
You're pretty much as
informed as TaN was.

00:05:19.144 --> 00:05:20.614
What's that supposed to mean?

00:05:24.124 --> 00:05:25.144
Where is he?

00:05:26.054 --> 00:05:27.754
Naobi disappeared.

00:05:27.824 --> 00:05:28.884
Disappeared?

00:05:29.394 --> 00:05:31.754
Was his account suspended, too?

00:05:31.894 --> 00:05:34.794
You're the only one who had
their account suspended.

00:05:35.064 --> 00:05:36.294
I see.

00:05:38.364 --> 00:05:40.734
So Naobi didn't quit...

00:05:40.804 --> 00:05:42.824
...but he just disappeared
from the game?

00:05:42.904 --> 00:05:44.334
Ask him in person.

00:05:44.404 --> 00:05:46.704
But I can't get a hold of him.

00:05:47.474 --> 00:05:49.464
Why did you come back?

00:05:51.644 --> 00:05:53.444
I have a score to settle.

00:05:53.514 --> 00:05:56.244
It took you a while to get back.

00:05:56.354 --> 00:05:58.184
I decided to study abroad.

00:05:58.454 --> 00:06:00.644
I was busy with that,
so I couldn't log in.

00:06:00.724 --> 00:06:02.714
Are you a student?

00:06:03.864 --> 00:06:05.584
I'm a university student.

00:06:05.664 --> 00:06:06.724
I'll be back.

00:06:11.134 --> 00:06:12.194
We did it!

00:06:14.274 --> 00:06:17.064
That was a pretty weak monster.

00:06:17.374 --> 00:06:19.174
It left this thing behind.

00:06:19.244 --> 00:06:20.704
But how do we use it?

00:06:21.314 --> 00:06:22.404
Look!

00:06:30.784 --> 00:06:32.614
We can't use those.

00:06:32.784 --> 00:06:34.984
We can get a better price
by selling through a shop...

00:06:35.054 --> 00:06:37.544
...than selling them directly
ourselves.

00:06:38.094 --> 00:06:40.324
Let's go to town
and try to sell them.

00:06:40.434 --> 00:06:41.394
Yeah.

00:06:42.294 --> 00:06:43.234
Pilo?

00:06:43.334 --> 00:06:44.264
Pilo?

00:06:44.364 --> 00:06:45.334
Huh?

00:06:45.704 --> 00:06:49.004
Is it really okay to be selling
at these prices?

00:06:49.404 --> 00:06:52.234
Hey, with an inflation like this...

00:06:52.304 --> 00:06:54.104
...what do you think Tawaraya
would do?

00:06:54.414 --> 00:06:56.874
Well, knowing him...

00:06:56.944 --> 00:06:58.604
...he'd probably make things
a bit cheaper.

00:06:59.244 --> 00:07:01.874
I think that Tohta character
is Tawaraya.

00:07:02.514 --> 00:07:04.484
I want him to acknowledge me.

00:07:04.554 --> 00:07:07.254
That's why I'm doing things
the way he would.

00:07:07.494 --> 00:07:09.184
Regarding that...

00:07:09.254 --> 00:07:12.284
...I think you should be a little
more sensitive to the situation.

00:07:12.364 --> 00:07:14.194
Huh? What do you mean?

00:07:14.264 --> 00:07:15.954
If your account is suspended...

00:07:16.034 --> 00:07:17.894
...and you come back as
a different character...

00:07:17.964 --> 00:07:20.404
...how would you feel about
being called your old name?

00:07:21.434 --> 00:07:22.764
You probably wouldn't like it.

00:07:22.834 --> 00:07:24.934
Why are these so cheap?

00:07:25.004 --> 00:07:25.834
Yeah, really.

00:07:25.904 --> 00:07:27.344
I can't believe it.

00:07:27.414 --> 00:07:29.844
That's because these are
the original prices.

00:07:29.914 --> 00:07:31.274
Take a good look.

00:07:31.684 --> 00:07:33.614
We want to sell these.

00:07:34.584 --> 00:07:38.114
It doesn't have to be much.
We don't need them.

00:07:38.184 --> 00:07:41.354
It's good to have more products.
Sure, I'll buy them.

00:07:41.654 --> 00:07:45.524
Besides, I think the price for those
weapons is in the TaN manual.

00:07:45.664 --> 00:07:46.624
TaN?

00:07:46.964 --> 00:07:47.984
Welcome.

00:07:50.634 --> 00:07:53.264
TaN isn't around anymore,
but this guy used to be their...

00:07:53.334 --> 00:07:54.394
Pilo!

00:07:55.504 --> 00:07:56.664
What is TaN?

00:07:57.244 --> 00:08:00.234
Until just recently
there was a guild that handled...

00:08:00.304 --> 00:08:03.304
...everything from information
to rare items.

00:08:03.844 --> 00:08:04.874
Information?

00:08:05.084 --> 00:08:07.414
Like if you had a friend
who stopped logging in...

00:08:07.484 --> 00:08:09.844
...and you want to know
where he is.

00:08:10.014 --> 00:08:11.984
Why don't you ask
about Tabby?

00:08:12.554 --> 00:08:13.524
Tabby?

00:08:14.124 --> 00:08:15.884
You know her?

00:08:16.494 --> 00:08:19.794
Well, yeah.
But I don't think she knows me.

00:08:21.234 --> 00:08:22.064
See!

00:08:22.134 --> 00:08:24.394
I think Tabby really
is famous!

00:08:24.664 --> 00:08:26.634
Who cares about that!

00:08:27.634 --> 00:08:28.794
All right!

00:08:29.604 --> 00:08:31.364
I'll buy these off of you.

00:08:31.444 --> 00:08:32.634
Will this much do?

00:08:32.704 --> 00:08:33.674
Yeah.

00:08:33.744 --> 00:08:35.174
Hey, let's go.

00:08:35.474 --> 00:08:40.214
If you find Tabby,
could you let us know?

00:08:40.314 --> 00:08:41.144
Sure.

00:08:41.214 --> 00:08:42.374
We'll count on you then.

00:08:43.654 --> 00:08:44.674
Come again.

00:08:46.484 --> 00:08:49.284
Sorry for stepping in like that.

00:08:49.354 --> 00:08:50.554
No problem!

00:08:50.764 --> 00:08:52.854
Nice to meet you.
I'm Ita.

00:08:52.924 --> 00:08:55.294
Right, I'm Tohta.

00:09:07.674 --> 00:09:11.704
Anyway, first give me all the money
and items you've got.

00:09:11.884 --> 00:09:15.044
I'll wire your pay
once I account for everything.

00:09:15.784 --> 00:09:18.814
What's this measly
amount of money?!

00:09:19.454 --> 00:09:21.254
What are you guys using?!

00:09:21.624 --> 00:09:24.654
The shop prices are so low lately...

00:09:24.724 --> 00:09:27.214
...that no one wants to pay
our prices.

00:09:27.764 --> 00:09:30.124
It seems it's because of
a guy called Tohta.

00:09:30.194 --> 00:09:31.224
Tohta?

00:09:32.164 --> 00:09:36.034
Come to think of it,
I saw him hanging around the shops.

00:09:37.374 --> 00:09:40.934
He's not a system administrator, is he?

00:09:41.044 --> 00:09:42.604
I don't think so.

00:09:43.044 --> 00:09:45.574
The prices started going down...

00:09:45.644 --> 00:09:47.874
...after he was chatting
to the former TaN members.

00:09:48.384 --> 00:09:49.904
It's only temporary.

00:09:50.054 --> 00:09:52.244
If it's a good item,
then people will pay for it.

00:09:52.324 --> 00:09:55.444
Even if it means using real money
to buy it from us.

00:09:55.524 --> 00:09:56.924
But, Ochi...

00:09:58.524 --> 00:10:00.054
No buts!

00:10:00.694 --> 00:10:03.634
The fact that we have a monopoly
on rare and strong items...

00:10:03.694 --> 00:10:04.994
...hasn't changed.

00:10:05.434 --> 00:10:06.364
You're right.

00:10:06.434 --> 00:10:07.294
Yeah.

00:10:07.374 --> 00:10:10.894
If you understand, then get going
and start making some money.

00:10:11.704 --> 00:10:12.634
Uh, right.

00:10:13.404 --> 00:10:14.394
Tohta...

00:10:16.744 --> 00:10:18.474
A remnant of TaN?

00:10:20.184 --> 00:10:22.174
Excuse me, Master Yata.

00:10:22.514 --> 00:10:23.484
What?

00:10:23.554 --> 00:10:26.114
There's a rumor
that Tawaraya has returned.

00:10:27.294 --> 00:10:30.654
I wonder if he knows
anything about us?

00:10:32.464 --> 00:10:34.124
Just leave him be.

00:10:34.194 --> 00:10:35.164
But...

00:10:45.004 --> 00:10:46.064
Master Yata?

00:10:46.744 --> 00:10:50.264
There is something
we must do.

00:11:02.994 --> 00:11:03.984
Pilo!

00:11:06.294 --> 00:11:07.594
Check this out, Pilo.

00:11:07.664 --> 00:11:08.924
Wow!

00:11:08.994 --> 00:11:11.524
I'm surprised you got to
the furthest area of the dungeon.

00:11:11.634 --> 00:11:13.654
Well, we are getting stronger.

00:11:14.074 --> 00:11:15.594
Can you buy it from us?

00:11:15.734 --> 00:11:16.764
Of course!

00:11:16.834 --> 00:11:18.324
I'll buy it from you.

00:11:18.874 --> 00:11:21.104
Thanks again, guys.

00:11:21.674 --> 00:11:23.734
You want to buy some armor
or anything?

00:11:24.214 --> 00:11:27.014
We haven't saved enough
for that yet.

00:11:27.084 --> 00:11:28.414
That's too bad.

00:11:28.484 --> 00:11:31.314
Be honest and just tell them
they don't have anything we want.

00:11:31.384 --> 00:11:33.684
- Yuta!
- It's Cashmere!

00:11:34.824 --> 00:11:38.854
Well, handling items
isn't our main thing.

00:11:39.194 --> 00:11:43.394
Next time you come, we'll be sure
to have things you'd like to buy.

00:11:43.934 --> 00:11:44.994
Okay.

00:11:45.064 --> 00:11:47.694
Come back whenever
you get something.

00:11:47.774 --> 00:11:48.734
Thanks.

00:11:49.404 --> 00:11:51.964
They're remnants of TaN, right?

00:11:52.304 --> 00:11:54.604
Can you believe
they're running a shop?

00:11:55.144 --> 00:11:57.334
Rumor says the prices are low...

00:11:57.414 --> 00:12:00.244
...because they're selling
TaN's inventory.

00:12:00.414 --> 00:12:02.574
We're safe in that respect.

00:12:02.654 --> 00:12:03.884
But we're expensive.

00:12:12.924 --> 00:12:15.084
Hey! How's business going?

00:12:16.634 --> 00:12:17.624
Slow?

00:12:17.834 --> 00:12:18.994
Well...

00:12:31.714 --> 00:12:35.584
There's a rumor that
we're remnants of TaN...

00:12:35.654 --> 00:12:38.674
...so customers aren't coming.

00:12:39.284 --> 00:12:41.514
If this keeps up,
we'll go bankrupt.

00:12:46.764 --> 00:12:47.884
Welcome!

00:13:01.014 --> 00:13:03.674
Are these all the items
you've got?

00:13:04.114 --> 00:13:06.674
This is all we have today.

00:13:08.554 --> 00:13:10.744
This shop sure is cheap.

00:13:10.854 --> 00:13:11.824
Yes.

00:13:11.984 --> 00:13:15.254
Is it safe to use this?

00:13:15.354 --> 00:13:16.914
What do you mean?

00:13:18.264 --> 00:13:23.394
I heard that all TaN dealt with
were cheat items.

00:13:23.694 --> 00:13:26.564
That guild called TaN
does not exist anymore.

00:13:27.364 --> 00:13:30.564
But you're a former member, right?

00:13:31.074 --> 00:13:34.534
I'm surprised you're back
in the business.

00:13:40.084 --> 00:13:41.274
Well, whatever.

00:14:11.384 --> 00:14:12.474
Hey.

00:14:12.914 --> 00:14:14.574
Why were you watching me?

00:14:14.654 --> 00:14:16.514
I wasn't watching you.

00:14:16.684 --> 00:14:18.744
Unfortunately,
Phyllo isn't here.

00:14:19.254 --> 00:14:20.654
Who are you?

00:14:20.824 --> 00:14:24.584
I was just passing by.
Why are you harassing me?

00:14:24.824 --> 00:14:26.594
Secret service, huh?

00:14:26.664 --> 00:14:27.564
What?

00:14:27.634 --> 00:14:28.894
Ender.

00:14:30.694 --> 00:14:35.864
Usually if someone is harassed,
they either ignore you or run away.

00:14:36.274 --> 00:14:39.404
But you engaged in conversation.

00:14:40.104 --> 00:14:41.704
Who's Ender?

00:14:41.974 --> 00:14:44.204
Quit mixing me up
with someone else.

00:14:44.284 --> 00:14:47.114
You can change how you speak,
but I know.

00:14:47.184 --> 00:14:49.414
Don't you remember
how long we worked together?

00:14:50.884 --> 00:14:52.354
Tell Naobi.

00:14:54.524 --> 00:14:59.084
Tonight I'm gong to lure the RMT
group and bring them down.

00:15:01.094 --> 00:15:03.724
A merchant does not
forgive debts.

00:15:04.334 --> 00:15:06.964
I have no idea
what you're talking about.

00:15:07.674 --> 00:15:08.604
Ender!

00:15:08.674 --> 00:15:09.634
Huh?

00:15:10.234 --> 00:15:13.474
It doesn't matter to you
if this world falls apart?

00:15:18.284 --> 00:15:19.674
I'm quitting.

00:15:19.914 --> 00:15:21.434
Why, all of a sudden?

00:15:21.514 --> 00:15:25.354
That former TaN guy said
he'll tell everyone I'm an RMT'er.

00:15:25.484 --> 00:15:27.144
You shouldn't let that bother you.

00:15:27.354 --> 00:15:31.454
He said he has proof and that
he'll show me tonight.

00:15:31.924 --> 00:15:32.854
Proof?

00:15:32.924 --> 00:15:34.524
Did he hack your log?

00:15:34.594 --> 00:15:36.564
How would I know?

00:16:04.294 --> 00:16:06.424
Do you really think he'll come?

00:16:07.494 --> 00:16:11.554
All we need to do is get them to
admit they're RMT'ing.

00:16:11.964 --> 00:16:14.404
What if they kill us before that?

00:16:14.804 --> 00:16:18.134
I believe in Tohta.

00:16:19.404 --> 00:16:20.734
I'm sorry.

00:16:23.144 --> 00:16:25.944
Is that all he wanted?

00:16:26.884 --> 00:16:27.844
Yes.

00:16:32.984 --> 00:16:34.954
What should we make of this?

00:16:37.694 --> 00:16:38.814
Pilo!

00:16:43.164 --> 00:16:46.694
If you have proof,
then please show me.

00:16:47.404 --> 00:16:49.064
Are we really going?

00:16:49.174 --> 00:16:51.664
We have to help people in trouble.
That's common sense.

00:16:51.804 --> 00:16:53.794
Maybe they're not in trouble!

00:16:53.874 --> 00:16:56.844
Ita said they'll have a showdown
with some bad guys.

00:16:56.914 --> 00:16:59.744
But that has nothing to do with us.

00:16:59.814 --> 00:17:01.744
Come on,
they taught us a lot.

00:17:02.384 --> 00:17:03.354
What?

00:17:05.124 --> 00:17:06.244
We're lost.

00:17:06.324 --> 00:17:07.844
Are you serious?

00:17:09.494 --> 00:17:10.824
What shall we do?

00:17:17.064 --> 00:17:18.094
It's me.

00:17:18.564 --> 00:17:20.534
Connect me
to the authorities.

00:17:20.864 --> 00:17:21.964
Master Yata?

00:17:22.904 --> 00:17:25.994
We know you guys are RMT'ing.

00:17:26.174 --> 00:17:28.574
So, show me the proof.

00:17:28.844 --> 00:17:32.144
Before we show you,
swear that you'll quit doing it.

00:17:34.244 --> 00:17:35.214
Get them.

00:17:36.654 --> 00:17:37.884
Is Tohta here yet?

00:17:38.424 --> 00:17:40.614
Soon. We have to hold up
until then.

00:17:40.994 --> 00:17:41.954
Tohta?

00:17:42.024 --> 00:17:45.554
So, you are remnants of TaN.

00:17:46.064 --> 00:17:48.254
Now I understand
why you get customers.

00:17:52.964 --> 00:17:53.934
Pilo!

00:18:04.344 --> 00:18:05.504
It's you guys!

00:18:05.614 --> 00:18:06.774
We came.

00:18:06.944 --> 00:18:08.714
Hurry and get up!

00:18:09.814 --> 00:18:11.374
This is interesting!

00:18:12.284 --> 00:18:13.614
What'll we do now?

00:18:13.684 --> 00:18:14.954
I don't know.

00:18:15.054 --> 00:18:16.954
Pilo, what should we do?

00:18:18.794 --> 00:18:19.814
I don't know.

00:18:20.094 --> 00:18:22.024
Leave the proof behind...

00:18:22.094 --> 00:18:23.684
...and get out of here.

00:18:24.434 --> 00:18:27.264
You are the ones
who ought to get out.

00:18:27.334 --> 00:18:28.424
Tohta!

00:18:28.704 --> 00:18:29.794
What?

00:18:29.874 --> 00:18:31.304
Don't you know?

00:18:31.374 --> 00:18:33.634
If you break the rules
your account will be suspended.

00:18:33.704 --> 00:18:35.644
Or maybe even terminated.

00:18:35.714 --> 00:18:36.904
So what?

00:18:41.614 --> 00:18:43.774
You'll appreciate an item
a lot more...

00:18:44.054 --> 00:18:47.614
...if you buy it with
the money you've saved.

00:18:47.684 --> 00:18:49.284
So, it is you.

00:18:49.694 --> 00:18:53.024
Don't you know there are PCs
who don't have the time for that?

00:18:54.164 --> 00:18:56.634
We're just supplying a demand.

00:18:56.734 --> 00:18:58.064
That's nonsense.

00:18:58.564 --> 00:19:01.224
You're selling because
there are people who want it.

00:19:01.304 --> 00:19:04.104
You're just like a gangster
selling illegal drugs.

00:19:04.334 --> 00:19:05.304
Are you stupid?

00:19:05.374 --> 00:19:06.844
It's just a game.

00:19:07.174 --> 00:19:09.444
If you're dealing
with real money...

00:19:09.514 --> 00:19:11.304
...then it's not just a game.

00:19:11.544 --> 00:19:13.484
I'll teach you something else.

00:19:13.984 --> 00:19:15.444
You're getting annoying.

00:19:15.514 --> 00:19:18.174
Children sure don't like
to listen to adults.

00:19:18.254 --> 00:19:19.224
Just listen.

00:19:19.654 --> 00:19:22.214
You don't know anything
about your customers.

00:19:22.554 --> 00:19:23.384
Huh?

00:19:23.454 --> 00:19:26.914
PCs who get the strongest
weapons with real money...

00:19:27.394 --> 00:19:30.194
...end up having a bad time
in the game.

00:19:30.334 --> 00:19:33.924
That's because their ability
isn't compatible with the weapon.

00:19:34.904 --> 00:19:37.134
Your business...

00:19:38.004 --> 00:19:39.974
...can't make the customer happy.

00:19:40.144 --> 00:19:42.264
I don't care, you bastard!

00:19:45.614 --> 00:19:46.634
Tohta!

00:19:46.784 --> 00:19:47.774
Oh, no!

00:19:47.884 --> 00:19:49.904
- Why?!
- What'll we do now?!

00:19:58.724 --> 00:20:02.064
Thank you for your patronage
in The World.

00:20:02.664 --> 00:20:04.854
By the authority
of the system administrator...

00:20:04.934 --> 00:20:06.524
...I regret to inform you that...

00:20:06.604 --> 00:20:08.904
...I have been ordered
to monitor you...

00:20:08.974 --> 00:20:10.874
...and keep your conversation
logs on file.

00:20:12.144 --> 00:20:16.544
We'd like to speak with you,
so you will be transferred.

00:20:23.784 --> 00:20:25.754
Sorry, but could you revive me?

00:20:33.964 --> 00:20:35.254
Hey, come again!

00:20:36.864 --> 00:20:38.624
It is you, Tawaraya!

00:20:39.734 --> 00:20:40.754
It's Tohta.

00:20:57.884 --> 00:20:59.254
It's funny.

00:20:59.324 --> 00:21:00.374
What is?

00:21:00.784 --> 00:21:04.354
I thought I'd lost everything
during that whole incident.

00:21:04.454 --> 00:21:06.624
But there were some things left,
after all.

00:21:06.824 --> 00:21:09.264
What kind of rare items
are they?

00:21:09.694 --> 00:21:12.294
They're definitely rare to me.

00:21:13.164 --> 00:21:16.464
I thought I'd leave
after I settled things...

00:21:16.974 --> 00:21:19.874
...but I think I'll continue until
I go abroad for my studies.

00:21:21.614 --> 00:21:22.664
I'll be back again.

00:21:38.394 --> 00:21:41.194
I've repaid my debt.

00:21:45.504 --> 00:21:49.064
I welcome you back
to this world...

00:21:53.444 --> 00:21:56.774
...from the bottom of my heart.

00:22:01.284 --> 00:22:02.374
Naobi...

00:22:29.414 --> 00:22:33.004
Ikiru wa dokuhai kiyu no kurushimi wo
Life is a poisoned cup of needless suffering

00:22:33.084 --> 00:22:36.514
Nomihosu sube wo dare ga sazukeyo
That no one can show me how to drain

00:22:36.784 --> 00:22:40.184
Taiyo ni sumu toiu kenja no washi
A wise eagle is said to live in the sun

00:22:40.254 --> 00:22:44.624
Habataki dake ga kodama suru
The flapping of its wings
is all that echoes

00:22:48.064 --> 00:22:51.594
Kono futatsu no me ni yadotta
In each of these eyes

00:22:51.664 --> 00:22:55.434
Yami to Hikari sono docchi de
Dwell darkness and light

00:22:55.504 --> 00:23:02.744
Boku wa ashita wo mitsumeru
beki nano darou
Through which shall I look to tomorrow?

00:23:02.814 --> 00:23:06.474
Kawaki kitta gareki no machi
A dried out and ruined city

00:23:06.544 --> 00:23:10.244
Ten to sen wo tsunagi awase
Draws the lines between the dots

00:23:10.314 --> 00:23:17.244
Imi nado nai koto bakari afurete iku
Causing meaningless events to overflow

00:23:17.424 --> 00:23:21.084
Honou no gotoki kodoku
Soothing the loneliness

00:23:21.164 --> 00:23:24.184
Idaku karada shizumete wa
That flames up within the body

00:23:24.264 --> 00:23:31.794
Ankyo eto shitatatte iku shizuku
Droplets of water fall towards the culvert

00:23:32.044 --> 00:23:35.534
Kakageru dokuhai kono sei wa michitemo
Even if the poisoned cup is upheld
and filled with this life

00:23:35.644 --> 00:23:39.344
Kogareru shino yume wa nagare tsuku
My dream that yearns for death
drifts into it

00:23:39.544 --> 00:23:42.984
Toride ni kuikomu tsume kokou no washi
The eagle remains aloof;
its talons dig into the fort

00:23:43.054 --> 00:23:46.614
Habataki dake ga maiagaru
Only the flapping of its wings resounds

00:23:46.684 --> 00:23:50.414
Ano soukyu ni takkei ni shite kure tamae
Let me be crucified in the blue sky

00:23:50.494 --> 00:23:53.894
Ten to chi ga musubu basho ni
bokuwa tatsu
I'll stand where heaven and earth meet

00:23:55.294 --> 00:23:56.524
Next Episode
